@startuml UC3_CatchPokemon_UseCase
title UC3 - Catch Pokemon (Use Case Diagram)
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Pokemon Catch System" {
  (In battle with wild Pokemon)
  (Select Catch action)
  (Has CaptureItems?)
  (Select CaptureItem type)
  (CatchService.ExecuteCapture)
  (CatchFormula.AttemptCatch)
  (CatchAttemptResult returned)
  (CatchService maps to CatchResult)
  (Pokemon caught)
  (Pokemon escaped)
  (Add to Player.PokemonTeam)
  (Consume CaptureItem)
  (Continue battle)
  (No Pokeballs)
}

Player --> (In battle with wild Pokemon)
(In battle with wild Pokemon) --> (Select Catch action)
(Select Catch action) --> (Has CaptureItems?)

(Has CaptureItems?) --> (Select CaptureItem type) : has balls
(Has CaptureItems?) --> (No Pokeballs) : empty

(Select CaptureItem type) --> (CatchService.ExecuteCapture)
(CatchService.ExecuteCapture) --> (CatchFormula.AttemptCatch) : <<include>>
(CatchFormula.AttemptCatch) --> (CatchAttemptResult returned)
(CatchAttemptResult returned) --> (CatchService maps to CatchResult)
(CatchService maps to CatchResult) --> (Pokemon caught) : IsCaught = true
(CatchService maps to CatchResult) --> (Pokemon escaped) : IsCaught = false

(Pokemon caught) --> (Add to Player.PokemonTeam)
(Pokemon caught) --> (Consume CaptureItem)
(Add to Player.PokemonTeam) --> Player

(Pokemon escaped) --> (Consume CaptureItem)
(Consume CaptureItem) --> (Continue battle)
(No Pokeballs) --> (Continue battle)
(Continue battle) --> Player

@enduml
